message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below. It is a student proposal seed, not a certification or an endorsed standard."
title: "dhamaan: source traced safety evidence, a checkable assurance case and preregistered simulation for robots and drones in Gulf conditions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mueen
    given-names: Huda
version: 1.8.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hudasol/dhamaan"
keywords:
  - assurance case
  - safety case
  - robotics
  - drones
  - GNSS
  - preregistration
abstract: >-
  A source traced evidence table of robot and drone safety instruments, a machine checkable assurance case with
  templates, a Gulf conditions test protocol, preregistered seeded simulations whose outputs are labelled synthetic,
  a local command line tool, a static site and a pilot kit. Licences are proposed until the owner confirms them.
